   "what": "the two dark states of the four-level system",
   "source": "Modern Atomic and Optical Physics II, 7.3 Adiabatic processes in multi-level systems, 7.3.2 Four-level systems",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "text": "Each field $\\kOmega_i$ couples the metastable state $|i\\rangle$ to the excited state $|2\\rangle$, on resonance and with real Rabi frequencies, as the fields of (7.24) do.",
